                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I was addicted to this game along time ago mid 2010s. Today of course its not as populated as it was back then but its still fun. My old account was in a browser gaming site and its completely lost. I met a lot of fun people and went into a lot of realms. I remember logging on mid 2020 and realizing all my friends are offline. The building is very great and is kind of similar to minecraft. Plus going into them island realms to farm for resources is super addicting. And the wiki is very helpful. Very great game but its pretty grindable.",
